<ul>
<li><a href="/scp-5070">SCP-5070</a> (&quot;Man's (Only) Best Friend&quot;) - Desktop staplers are men's best friends. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nickthebrick1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5208936); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5208936&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="Nickthebrick1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5208936)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nickthebrick1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5208936); return false;">Nickthebrick1</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/scp-5859">SCP-5859</a> (&quot;The PENTAGRAM Papers&quot;) - Your favorite good old-fashioned conspiracy, like the old days. You like it? Revealed by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4188420); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4188420&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="Anorrack" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4188420)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4188420); return false;">Anorrack</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/scp-5952">SCP-5952</a> (&quot;The Warbalang&quot;) - It rhymes with &quot;Trashwang&quot;. Not a strange animal discovered by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;">UraniumEmpire</a></span>, even if the name looks like that.</li>
</ul>
<h4><span>Tales</span></h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/grape-flavored-cigars-and-funeral-pyres">Grape Flavored Cigars and Funeral Pyres</a> - &quot;<em>You know, I helped you out after last time, so I just need you to pass me your answer key…&quot;</em> Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iapetus-the-acausal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5305138); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5305138&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="Iapetus The Acausal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5305138)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iapetus-the-acausal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5305138); return false;">Iapetus The Acausal</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/kelipat">Kelipat Nogah</a> - &quot;<em>With the inclusion of Paraspecialists provided by the GOC and the CotBG, Xi-8 should now be able to handle most, if not all mid-level Sarkic Infestations.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span>.</li>
</ul>
<h4><span>GoI Formats</span></h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/ambrose-three-portlands">Ambrose Three Portlands</a> - [Ambrose Restaurants] It's about time. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/a-cosmic-cycle">A Cosmic Cycle</a> - [Arcadia] It's in a 8-bit setting, so it looks less impressive, but it will still be a cosmic cycle. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lillithhollymisato" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6880118); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6880118&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="LillithHollyMisato" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6880118)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lillithhollymisato" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6880118); return false;">LillithHollyMisato</a></span>.</li>
