<ul>
<li><a href="/scp-5585">SCP-5585</a> (&quot;Immortalized&quot;) - <em>Real Keters don't die / Forward with the plot / Five-Five-Eight-Five / Form at the plot.</em> Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5053587); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5053587&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="RadioactiveRADS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5053587)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5053587); return false;">RadioactiveRADS</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a> (&quot;Those that do not wish to be forgotten&quot;) - So, here's what we do for not forget them. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5986843); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5986843); return false;">Ralliston</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/scp-5539">SCP-5539</a> (&quot;Pub Crawl&quot;) - Getting drunk is more, more fun when other dimensions are involved. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cptnubz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2983611); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2983611&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="cptnubz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2983611)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cptnubz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2983611); return false;">cptnubz</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/scp-5481">SCP-5481</a> (&quot;The Hugging Trees&quot;) - You would not refuse a hug from them, isn't it? See, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethanhanson" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4465845); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4465845&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="EthanHanson" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4465845)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethanhanson" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4465845); return false;">EthanHanson</a></span> hugged them and now, they're more happy in their everyday life.</li>
</ul>
<h4><span>Tales</span></h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/ocular-variant">Ocular Variant</a> - &quot;<em>Until the communists had decided to remove and eliminate him as well, for reasons unbeknown.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cold-nights" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6781818); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6781818&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="cold_Nights" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6781818)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cold-nights" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6781818); return false;">cold_Nights</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/big-fish-in-the-sky">Big Fish In The Sky</a> - <em>&quot;That is a story for another day. Alright. It's time for bed, sleepy monkey. Have a nice dream.&quot;</em> Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kirq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6152598); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6152598&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="KirQ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6152598)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kirq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6152598); return false;">KirQ</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/the-life-everlasting">The Life Everlasting</a> - &quot;<em>And some hurts could not be forgotten - the decades stewing in filth still haunted him at night.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3337265); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3337265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3337265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3337265); return false;">Tufto</a></span>.</li>
<li><a href="/gomboc">Gömböc</a> - &quot;<em>Then she looked down at SCP-4051 and that confusion evolved into anger. Her words made the walls rattle.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/redredred" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5379342); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5379342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1604950644" alt="redredred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5379342)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/redredred" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5379342); return false;">redredred</a></span>.</li>
